---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
// Hero section component
---

<header
    class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden px-6 md:px-12 lg:pl-32 pt-20 pb-32"
>
    {/* Background Image/Portrait */}
    <div
        class="absolute right-[-20px] md:right-0 lg:right-[5%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[280px] md:w-[380px] lg:w-[480px] aspect-[3/4] z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-90 transition-all duration-500"
    >
        <picture>
            <source srcset="/wojciech-hero.avif" type="image/avif" />
            <source srcset="/wojciech-hero.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img
                alt="Wojciech Smolarek - Technical SEO Specialist"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-multiply brightness-110 contrast-100"
                style={{
                    maskImage:
                        "linear-gradient(to bottom, black 80%, transparent 100%)",
                    WebkitMaskImage:
                        "linear-gradient(to bottom, black 80%, transparent 100%)",
                }}
                src="/wojciech-hero.png"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
                width="480"
                height="640"
            />
        </picture>
    </div>

    {/* Vertical Text */}
    <div
        class="absolute left-6 md:left-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 hidden lg:block z-20"
    >
        <div
            class="rotate-180 [writing-mode:vertical-rl] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gray-600 mix-blend-difference"
        >
            Specjalista Technical SEO <span class="my-4 inline-block">//</span> Logi,
            Crawl, Migracje
        </div>
    </div>

    {/* Main Headline */}
    <div
        class="relative z-10 max-w-full md:max-w-[50vw] lg:max-w-[65vw]"
    >
        <p
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="text-[clamp(3rem,10vw,10rem)] font-display font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter text-primary drop-shadow-sm pointer-events-none select-none"
        >
            WOJCIECH<br />SMOLAREK
        </p>
        <h1
            class="mt-6 font-display text-lg md:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary max-w-xl"
        >
            Technical SEO Specialist — audyty techniczne SEO, analiza logów i migracje dużych serwisów
        </h1>
    </div>

    {/* Intro Text */}
    <div
        class="mt-24 md:mt-16 max-w-md relative z-30 md:max-w-[45vw] lg:max-w-md"
    >
        <p
            class="font-sans text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-primary font-medium"
        >
            Twój serwis działa, a mimo to Google go nie widzi? Wchodzę w logi i sprawdzam, co Googlebot naprawdę robi — na których adresach traci czas, a które omija. Potem mówię wprost, co jest zepsute i w jakiej kolejności to naprawić.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
            <span class="h-[1px] w-12 bg-black"></span>
            <span class="uppercase text-xs font-bold tracking-widest"
                >Otwarty na projekty</span
            >
        </div>
    </div>

    {/* Scroll Indicator */}
    <div
        class="absolute bottom-12 left-6 md:left-12 lg:left-32 animate-bounce-slow"
    >
        <Icon name="south" class="w-8 h-8" />
    </div>
</header>
